{"id":"e172de9c93804582","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-lowforschnorr.md","title":"Schnorr 随机低性","display":"df-lowforschnorr — Schnorr 随机低性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-lowforschnorr","aliases":["43-df-lowforschnorr"],"display":"df-lowforschnorr — Schnorr 随机低性","depends_on":["[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"§16.1, printed pp.480–488 / PDF pp.500–508","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-lowforschnorr"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-lowforschnorr</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lowforschnorr — Schnorr 随机低性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§16.1, printed pp.480–488 / PDF pp.500–508"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}^A\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForSchnorr}(A)\\iff\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\,[\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}^A(X)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LowForSchnorr}(A)\\iff\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\,[\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}^A(X)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>需使用相对 Schnorr 测试中 A 可计算的测度精度，不能只相对化开集索引。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}$、$\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}^A$ 见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LowForSchnorr}(A)\\iff\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\,[\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}^A(X)].","display":true}],"bytes":1025,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-351","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-lowforschnorr]] — Schnorr 随机低性"},{"id":"1bf7d60bf0eb9172","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{LowForSchnorr}$、$\\mathrm{LowForKurtzTest},\\mathrm{LowForKurtz}$、$\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}$ 见 [[43-df-lowforschnorr]]、[[43-df-kurtz-low]]、[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]。"},{"id":"a11b09eb86743e34","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{LowForSchnorr}$、$\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}$ 见 [[43-df-lowforschnorr]]、[[43-df-computably-traceable]]。"},{"id":"2c0b8291767d13ef","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{LowForSchnorr}$ 见 [[43-df-lowforschnorr]]，$\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}$ 见 [[43-df-schnorr-trivial]]。机器低性采用 [[43-df-lowforcomputable-machines]]、[[43-df-rel-computable-prefix-machine]] 的接口；可计算可迹性的等价刻画见 [[43-thm-lowforschnorr-char]]、[[43-thm-lowforcomputable-machines-char]]。"},{"id":"11d044ca7f8f7dac","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；见 [[43-df-lowforschnorr]]、[[43-df-lowforschnorrtest]]、[[43-thm-lowforschnorr-char]]、[[43-thm-schnorr-low-tests]]。"}],"outgoing":["c8d43a74ea8721f3"]}